ass=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\cdot|:V\\to V\">\\(|\\cdot|:V\\to V\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcPcf4TransversalFamily}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcPcf4TransversalFamily}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"359a24d272ff7fc3\" href=\"?note=359a24d272ff7fc3\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-zfc-pcf4-transversal-family.md\">../batch03/58-df-zfc-pcf4-transversal-family.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcComb9AlmostFreeFamily}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcComb9AlmostFreeFamily}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb9\\text{-}almost\\text{-}free\\text{-}family} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcComb9AlmostFreeFamily}_S(\\mathcal{F},\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\n\\land|\\mathcal F|=\\kappa\n\\land\\mathcal F\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\bigcup\\mathcal F)\n\\land\\varnothing\\notin\\mathcal F\n\\land\\forall\\mathcal G\\subseteq\\mathcal F\\;\\Bigl(\n|\\mathcal G|&lt;\\kappa\\to\n\\exists T\\;\\mathrm{ZfcPcf4TransversalFamily}_S(\\mathcal G,T)\n\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb9\\text{-}almost\\text{-}free\\text{-}family} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcComb9AlmostFreeFamily}_S(\\mathcal{F},\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\n\\land|\\mathcal F|=\\kappa\n\\land\\mathcal F\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\bigcup\\mathcal F)\n\\land\\varnothing\\notin\\mathcal F\n\\land\\forall\\mathcal G\\subseteq\\mathcal F\\;\\Bigl(\n|\\mathcal G|&lt;\\kappa\\to\n\\exists T\\;\\mathrm{ZfcPcf4TransversalFamily}_S(\\mathcal G,T)\n\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>此处“自由”采用集合族具有横截系的组合论语义；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\mathcal F|=\\kappa\">\\(|\\mathcal F|=\\kappa\\)</span> 保证参数记录该族的实际基数，而不是任取一个较大的基数使“小子族”条件失真。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-zfc-pcf4-transversal-family.md","status":"resolved","id":"359a24d272ff7fc3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-zfc-pcf4-transversal-family.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\subseteq V$（see [[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]）","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$|\\cdot|:V\\to V$（see [[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]）","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-zfc-pcf4-transversal-family.md","status":"resolved","id":"359a24d272ff7fc3","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","l